<tbody>
<tr><td>Flow ownership</td><td>Named order tracking owner on every journey</td><td>order tracking ghosts sending expired incentives</td></tr>
<tr><td>Naming convention</td><td>Name order tracking flows job-first, audience-second</td><td>Unnamed order tracking sprawl unauditable in season</td></tr>
<tr><td>Change log</td><td>order tracking-flow history recorded per change</td><td>Mystery order tracking dips nobody can source</td></tr>
<tr><td>Access control</td><td>Limit order tracking edit rights tightly</td><td>Over-permissioned order tracking editors misfiring</td></tr>
